d Archibald - Gretel seeks purpose in her afterlife - guiding Archibald back to the sanctuary she was long ago exiled from. This journey will be along a perilous path, fraught with all manner of grotesque demons starving for souls. </p>", "short_description": "Magenta Horizon is a fast-paced 2D action platformer with challenging spectacle fighter inspired combat. Playing as a Reaper of the twisted purgatorial afterlife, push your skills to the limit to destroy the hordes of demons and epic bosses to reach your destination.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, German, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A lurid, surreal (but beautifully drawn) 2D character action brawler. Like a 2D Devil May Cry riffing off the squishy stretchy art of Mommy's Best Games and Vanillaware equally.”<br>Dominic Tarason<br><br>“The title shines in its combat and its fluid and responsive movement. (...)the game encourages a more aggressive approach, with its gameplay systems that allow you to have the power to control an entire room full of varied enemies.”<br>8/10 – gamfm<br><br>“The work done by the only developer who denotes love and competence in the genre is impressive. The game itself keeps what it promises until the end: a challenge for the player.”<br>7.8/10 – INDIE GAMES DEVEL<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109060/header.jpg?t=1770583520", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770583520", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2109060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770583520", "website": "https://2leftthumbs.manakeep.com/magenta-horizon", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</stro